OL,3,GNEWSAMenai Bridge repairs delayed by a
OL,4,Afurther six months
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on one of the two bridges linking
OL,7,FAnglesey to the rest of Wales has been
OL,8,Fdelayed by a further six months.
OL,10,FDrivers crossing the 200-year-old Menai
OL,11,Fsuspension bridge have endured delays,
OL,12,Fweight restrictions and closures for
OL,13,Fmore than four years.
OL,15,FThe latest delay to the repair and
OL,16,Frefurbishment works has been caused by
OL,17,Fthe discovery of damp underneath the
OL,18,Froad deck, which is preventing it from
OL,19,Fbeing painted.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
