OL,3,GNEWSAMenai Bridge repairs delayed by a
OL,4,Afurther six months
OL,5,
OL,6,FUK Highways A55 Ltd, which is in charge
OL,7,Fof maintaining the bridge, said it
OL,8,Fhoped to keep any further disruption to
OL,9,Fa minimum while it completes the
OL,10,Frefurbishment.
